description	"Padme Naberrie Amidala Skywalker

An aggressive negotiator suited for both frontline and support. Powerful in proximity to friendly Saberists.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- ELG-3A Diplomat's Pistol (3)
-- 10% more damage
-- 10% more FP drain
-- 20% faster RoF
- Looted E-5 Blaster Rifle (A280 1)
-- 10% more damage
-- 20% faster RoF
- Bacta Grenade (4) (Frag)
-- Team-heals/drains on det
-- 250% larger secondary fire splash
-- 100% less damage
- Pulse Grenade (3)
- V-59 Conc Grenade (1)

^5Powers:
- Team Energize (1)

^6Inventory:
- Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)
- Rally
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Ally Stat Viewer
- 5% more knockback given

^3Abilities:
- BP/Resource Dispenser (3)/(2) ^3[Use]
-- +3 range
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (3) ^3[CS3]"